  "notes": "{測|はか}る means to measure physical quantities like length, temperature, or distance.\n\nTRANSITIVITY:\n- Type: ⟦{他動詞|たどうし}→他動詞：10418_tadoushi⟧ (transitive)\n- Takes ⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧ particle for the thing being measured\n\nKANJI VARIANTS (all read はかる):\n- {測|はか}る: measure physical quantities (length, temperature)\n- ⟦{計|はか}る→計る：28292_hakaru⟧: measure time; also plan, scheme\n- ⟦{量|はか}る→量る：28293_hakaru⟧: weigh, measure volume/quantity\n- ⟦{図|はか}る→図る：12006_hakaru⟧: attempt, aim for (abstract)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- ⟦{長|なが}さ→長さ：05326_nagasa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{測|はか}る: to measure length\n- ⟦{体温|たいおん}→体温：03385_taion⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{測|はか}る: to take temperature\n- ⟦{距離|きょり}→距離：05331_kyori⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{測|はか}る: to measure distance\n- ⟦{深|ふか}さ→深さ：05328_fukasa⟧⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧{測|はか}る: to measure depth\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{測定|そくてい}→測定：04398_sokutei⟧: measurement (noun)\n- ⟦{計測|けいそく}→計測：14189_keisoku⟧: measurement, surveying\n- ⟦{温度計|おんどけい}→温度計：25699_ondokei⟧: thermometer",
